{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy Up: The Inventory Sorting Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong><u>organizing items in an inventory</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve started a part-time job at a shop that specializes in inventory sorting.<br>Customers bring in messy inventories, and it\u2019s your job to tidy them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014if you mess up, customers will get angry and sales will drop.<br>Keep the shop running for 30 days without hitting zero funds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CillMode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main mode, running out of funds means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in <strong>Chill Mode</strong>, there\u2019s no pressure \u2014 just endless inventory sorting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, organize, and enjoy a relaxing time with your viewers!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104260?t=1763784197","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104260?t=1763784197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104260/3b40b2193383a280644a3cba653f6cf9accb2a4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763784197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104260/3b40b2193383a280644a3cba653f6cf9accb2a4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763784197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy Up: The Inventory Sorting Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong><u>organizing items in an inventory</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve started a part-time job at a shop that specializes in inventory sorting.<br>Customers bring in messy inventories, and it\u2019s your job to tidy them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014if you mess up, customers will get angry and sales will drop.<br>Keep the shop running for 30 days without hitting zero funds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CillMode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main mode, running out of funds means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in <strong>Chill Mode</strong>, there\u2019s no pressure \u2014 just endless inventory sorting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, organize, and enjoy a relaxing time with your viewers!</p>","developers":["GameShock"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104260/3b655d76cef86cf60dd18b63f3bdebe3659fb5b2/header.jpg?t=1763784197","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104260/1585695894/ae0841f3d033f8b5a65f0daa57aceab84f76f390/1760179597/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762533124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104260/1585695894/ae0841f3d033f8b5a65f0daa57aceab84f76f390/1760179597/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762533124","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104260/1585695894/ae0841f3d033f8b5a65f0daa57aceab84f76f390/1760179597/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762533124","id":257216015,"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216015/d020cc6439a77c17dedc76b8ba